===== WHAT THIS PROVES =====
Enterprise Killer Demo v0.1 / Demo A proves that already proven layers can be
assembled into one coherent enterprise demo.

It proves Root final boundary survives dirty enterprise inputs.
It proves connector observations are not truth.
It proves evidence candidates require acceptance gates.
It proves LLM drafts do not become final decisions.
It proves DRS reuse is context, not authority.
It proves Developer Facade remains candidate-only.
It proves Transition Matrix blocks invalid external action.
It proves Production Boundary blocks production overclaim.
It proves compute collapse can be shown as a proof-level estimate.

===== WHAT THIS DOES NOT PROVE =====
It does not prove production readiness.
It does not prove real API integration.
It does not prove real external action.
It does not prove real shipment release.
It does not prove real payment trigger.
It does not prove production persistence.
It does not prove real cost savings.
It does not prove real latency measurements.
It does not prove real billing measurements.
It does not create installed capability.
It does not create installed Needle.
It does not implement External/global DRS.
It does not activate Marennya or UP.
It does not implement Enterprise Document Killer Demo B.
It does not implement a document/evidence workflow.

